                                "sense_id": "f1cec938-962a-356c-8613-10342cd98064",
                                "text": "“[…] This sand,” he said vaguely; then he said it again, viciously, “this sand. This goddam sand. Its like a goddam fuckin desert.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b9c828aa-0d7b-474b-927f-8f062214ac19",
                                "sense_id": "f1cec938-962a-356c-8613-10342cd98064",
                                "text": "The funny part was, though, we were the worst skaters on the whole goddam rink."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5d1367fb-aa3b-40b1-813d-a03b097458b2",
                                "sense_id": "f1cec938-962a-356c-8613-10342cd98064",
                                "text": "‘No, Paul, not now and not in this goddam car!’"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
